OL,3,GNEWSAVault collapses in church
OL,4,Agraveyard after storm
OL,5,
OL,6,FChurchgoers arriving for a Sunday
OL,7,Fservice were greeted with a collapsed
OL,8,Fvault in the graveyard.
OL,10,FThe vault at St Mary's church in
OL,11,FMarston Moretaine, Bedfordshire, dates
OL,12,Fto 1753.
OL,14,FAccording to former churchwarden Steve
OL,15,FMurphy, the vault collapsed during the
OL,16,Frecent storms following the drought.
OL,18,FThe Archdeacon of Bedford Dave
OL,19,FMiddlebrook said the priority was "to
OL,20,Fensure the safety of visitors and to
OL,21,Ftreat this historic burial place with
OL,22,Fappropriate care and respect".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
